    "detailed_description": "FAIRE HOLLOW is a cozy 2D farming sim and RPG, where you <strong>manage a Renaissance Faire</strong>.<br><br>Huzzah! You are a struggling event planner who's been given one last chance to prove yourself: your job is to take over the renaissance festival and restore it to its former glory!<br><br>To manage the ren faire you must establish new <strong>attractions and games</strong>, manage <strong>food vendors and shops</strong>, and <strong>interact</strong> with the eccentric locals. But beware late at night: the festival holds secrets and hidden dangers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Bring your festival to life</strong> as you explore a rich and colorful 2D world that changes with the seasons and offers secrets around every corner. Gather materials to <strong>craft items</strong>, <strong>tame animals</strong>, <strong>brew mead</strong>, and <strong>learn magical spells</strong>. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7386385cd891bc6ca2b53f9f5def7da4.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7386385cd891bc6ca2b53f9f5def7da4.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7386385cd891bc6ca2b53f9f5def7da4.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Transform your humble festival grounds by cultivating a variety of <strong>crops</strong>. Harvest fruits, vegetables, and herbs to create <strong>unique dishes and brews</strong> that will delight your visitors. Use your harvested materials to craft beautiful items and powerful tools: wands, swords, armor, and much more. The more you grow and create, the more your festival will flourish.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7dd54486af55ca40dffed103ebc07f9f.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7dd54486af55ca40dffed103ebc07f9f.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7dd54486af55ca40dffed103ebc07f9f.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When the sun sets, the festival grounds reveal <strong>mysteries unexplained</strong>. Prepare to battle mythical <strong>creatures</strong> and fend off mischievous fairies and fearsome monsters. <strong>Strengthen your character</strong>, unlock new abilities, and gather rare materials from your fallen foes to further enhance your festival.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7c0cf18fdc136b4fc220ee3c355d327b.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7c0cf18fdc136b4fc220ee3c355d327b.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/7c0cf18fdc136b4fc220ee3c355d327b.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Your ultimate goal</strong> is to build the most spectacular renaissance faire the world has ever seen. Design and upgrade <strong>enchanting attractions</strong>, curate <strong>captivating performances</strong>, and ensure every guest experiences the magic of the festival. Your success will draw in bigger crowds, rare merchants, and unique characters with their <strong>own storylines and quests</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><i><strong>Faire Hollow</strong></i> is built entirely by a full-time <strong>solo indie developer</strong>. My name is @alMoo. You can follow along and contribute on the Discord: I regularly post progress videos and dev logs, and I'd love your feedback. I am passionate about this game, and it is truly gratifying to be able to share it with you.",
    "about_the_game": "FAIRE HOLLOW is a cozy 2D farming sim and RPG, where you <strong>manage a Renaissance Faire</strong>.<br><br>Huzzah! You are a struggling event planner who's been given one last chance to prove yourself: your job is to take over the renaissance festival and restore it to its former glory!<br><br>To manage the ren faire you must establish new <strong>attractions and games</strong>, manage <strong>food vendors and shops</strong>, and <strong>interact</strong> with the eccentric locals. But beware late at night: the festival holds secrets and hidden dangers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=58 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/1a314b565cac10fa7cdbc1463148333b.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.poster.avif?t=1717161366\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.webm?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751260/extras/f85c0e79462d6249f0396de65e81affb.mp4?t=1717161366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Bring your festival to life</strong> as you explore a rich and colorful 2D world that changes with the seasons and offers secrets around every corner. 